; apps/office: mini-office, the author's playground's
; apps/office/TinyOffice (docs/plans/plan_office.md), and what it
; stands on that no other program here uses, in folders (folders only:
; one library, ix_office):
;   document/  Saved: a document's bytes (its appkits/document)
;   richtext/  Style, Rich, Page: a text with looks, and its lines laid
;              out (its appkits/richtext)
;   paint/     Bitmap, Pattern, Seed_fill, Paint: a picture as bits
;              (its appkits/paint)
;   draw/      Figure, Drawing: a picture as objects (its appkits/draw)
;   shapes/    what draws those as Playground shapes: Stroke_text
;              (Hershey's strokes in a look), Figure_shapes
;   formula/   Formula: a sheet's formulas (its languages/formula)
;   sheet/     Sheet, Sheet_view: a spreadsheet's cells, each recomputed
;              when what it reads changes, and how one is drawn (its
;              appkits/sheet, appkits/sheet_view)
;   file_menu/ File_menu: New, Open, Save, Save As, Export and their
;              dialogs, over the platform's store of documents
;   parts/     Component (what a part of a document has to be able to
;              do) and the five parts: a text, a sheet, a picture, a
;              drawing, a chart
; The first four and formula/ draw nothing. Undo, which examples/'s
; Gui7Circles uses too, is apps/kits'; examples/'s Gui7Cells is linked
; with this library for its sheet.
; (a file's text is the playground's: what it leaves unused stays, no
; warning of it an error)
(include_subdirs unqualified)

(library
 (name ix_office)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules :standard \ Office)
 (flags (:standard -w -32-37-69))
 (libraries ix_kits ix_gui ix_playground ix_playground_render ix_graphics_software ix_compression ix_core caps))

; the program, with the platform that writes a frame to a file (the
; tests'); mini-mk's mkfile chooses the platform; sdl/ is the one with
; a window, bin/mini-office
(executable
 (name Office)
 (modules Office)
 (flags (:standard -w -32-37-69))
 (libraries ix_office ix_kits ix_gui ix_playground ix_playground_render ix_playground_ppm ix_core caps unix))
